{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788582566998645001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"restless-contagious-cougar","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"d268ee6c35fe91412726831004adf320ae593739bf3072837b786074ca761684","event_uuid":"605dae9a-5fce-4b58-9171-36e2b81916c5","position":{"commit_sha":"7257c5b81212baf4916db6f6bb5fd526812d8df6","position":"1788570353968986542-605dae9a-5fce-4b58-9171-36e2b81916c5"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"78ca249625fa3d522c9d8ee05c2f93f0dad08ecc61cbec70946fe525f70c6431","event_uuid":"82293f23-c4c7-439f-b286-1026c403b5ec","position":{"commit_sha":"9bd34653159461d8a4a335533b97984cd6e40b24","position":"1788570358305879952-82293f23-c4c7-439f-b286-1026c403b5ec"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"c8a8b930ccdf3068c502101c3376d0ed81e2e779252c8cab715c46e3bc27aa56","event_uuid":"f8cb6d1a-c0a2-4973-a7cf-4de3ae84f645","position":{"commit_sha":"9fc83fdab322fad32f35b0a5f7f25aaff4afa343","position":"1788573052900981755-f8cb6d1a-c0a2-4973-a7cf-4de3ae84f645"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788570353968986542,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\nMaintainer and analysis tooling under `scripts/`. contains confirmed comment or docstring bloat from the audit pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`. The file-specific constraints must survive consolidation.\n\n## Approach\nDelegate remediation to bounded directory/subsystem leaf cohorts. Each leaf edits only its declared paths, preserves the requirements recorded in its Scope, and supplies the authoritative file-impact set. This keeps responsibilities non-overlapping and each change reviewable in one session.\n\n## Scope\n- Direct container edits: none; repository edits belong to the leaf cohorts.\n- Delegated repository area: Maintainer and analysis tooling under `scripts/`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every migrated path in this workstream appears in exactly one leaf Scope and matching file-impact record; verified by the migration inventory.\n- [ ] Each path's comments or docstrings retain its listed current constraints and consumer contract while removing redundant text; verified by the leaf's row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Each leaf's declared verification commands exit 0 before that leaf closes.\n\n## Child decomposition\nEach directory/subsystem cohort owns all three criteria for its exact path set. Cohort path sets are disjoint; their union is this workstream's scope.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","3e32-a859-2153-4a1b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"This workstream container makes no repository edits directly. Its leaf group tickets hold the exact paths; their commits and completion comments are the implementation evidence.","parent_id":"3e32-a859-2153-4a1b","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"3de8-31a0-25ef-456d","ticket_type":"story","title":"Condense developer-tooling comments","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["605dae9a-5fce-4b58-9171-36e2b81916c5","82293f23-c4c7-439f-b286-1026c403b5ec","f8cb6d1a-c0a2-4973-a7cf-4de3ae84f645"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788582566998645001,"uuid":"3875c164-bc16-4ba1-ab8d-0b0efafefdae"}